    "directions": [
      "In hot pan add oil and saute onion and ginger garlic paste until turn light pink. Now add paneer, green peas and soy kheema and saute for another few minutes.",
      "Add pavbhaji masala and chopped green chili. Add chopped coriander leaves. Remove and allow it to cool.",
      "Apply little oil to all the tomatoes.",
      "Stuff this masala into tomatoes. Top it up with cheese and bake into the oven at 180*C for 15 minutes.",
      "Remove and serve hot."
    ],
